  "rationale": "The plant automaton G1 models the robot's combined perception and motion execution, capturing all possible sensor outcomes and motion commands. The specification automaton E1 enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: it binds clear states to forward/random_walk actions, obstacle states to conservative recovery (backward or directed turn), and ensures quick return to exploration after recovery. It prevents unsafe actions (e.g., forward into obstacles), avoids oscillatory turning, and uses full_rotate only as a last-resort escape after repeated blockages.",
